PIS 0.5.0 - 2026-11-15

* Added a Date and Time menu immediately after Locale.
* Integrated Slackware's native timeconfig with automatic backups and status.
* Added optional NTP pool configuration with a delimited /etc/ntp.conf block.
* Added safe enable, disable, start, stop and status handling for rc.ntpd.
* Recorded timezone, hardware-clock mode, NTP state and pool in PIS status.
* Added regression tests for timeconfig and NTP configuration.

PIS 0.4.8 - 2026-11-15

* Added one explicit top-level GRUB entry for every kernel selected in PIS.
* Added selection of the default PIS GRUB kernel.
* Prevented GRUB's automatic scan of /boot from overriding the PIS selection.
* Kept automatically discovered GRUB entries as recovery alternatives.
* Validated the complete generated grub.cfg with grub-script-check.
* Recorded whether each changed file previously existed, allowing Restore to
  remove files that PIS originally created.
* Recorded the selected bootloader and GRUB default kernel in PIS status.

PIS 0.4.7 - 2026-11-15

* Added explicit bootloader selection when multiple configurations are present.
* Stopped treating an installed GRUB package as a configured GRUB bootloader.
* Reported every detected bootloader configuration in the system check.

PIS 0.4.5 - 2026-11-15

* Added an explicit legacy-BIOS LILO memory mode for 32-bit systems.
* Added compact initrd generation without optional filesystem repair tools.
* Required LILO to confirm low-memory initrd placement before installing the boot map.

PIS 0.4.4 - 2026-11-15

* Preserved existing PIS-managed LILO entries as preselected checklist items.
* Clarified that the checklist represents the complete published kernel set.
* Distinguished SMP and non-SMP kernels and marked the running flavor as recommended.

PIS 0.4.3 - 2026-11-14

* Delegated initrd creation directly to Slackware's command generator pipeline.
* Added matching kernel module checks before generic kernel publication.
* Added gzip validation and persistent mkinitrd diagnostic logs.

PIS 0.4.2 - 2026-11-14

* Kept mkinitrd status output out of generated LILO configuration files.

PIS 0.4.1 - 2026-11-14

* Fixed Slackware x86 SMP kernel version detection for initrd generation.
* Preserved the root device already validated in lilo.conf.
* Added detailed LILO validation logs and retained failed candidate files.

PIS 0.4.0 - 2026-11-14

* Added Slackware 15.0 and current detection from slackpkg and system data.
* Added x86 and x86_64 mirror and repository selection.
* Enabled AlienBOB and restricted repositories for all supported combinations.
* Limited multilib choices to x86_64 and stable-only binaries to Slackware 15.0.
* Added ELILO, LILO and GRUB bootloader detection and kernel publication.
* Expanded regression tests to cover the four release/architecture combinations.

PIS 0.3.0 - 2026-11-07

* Installed the shared shell library in /usr/lib{64}/pis instead of /sbin.
* Added automatic backup and restoration of changed configuration files.
* Added a configuration/status screen and a system compatibility check.
* Added a shared implementation used by menus and profile application.
* Added versioned, validated profiles that never store passwords.
* Changed slackpkg profiles to store mirror URLs instead of line numbers.
* Added current-state information to configuration menus.
* Hid password input and stopped recording user passwords.
* Preserved supplementary groups when adding a user to wheel.
* Validated sudoers changes with visudo.
* Reworked ELILO publication and initrd generation, including NVMe roots.
* Stopped treating the root filesystem as a resume device.
* Removed incompatible OpenSSL library symlink creation.
* Updated package integrations for Slackware 15.0 and rejected current repos.
* Added download, package and post-installation result checks.
* Generated X keyboard menus from the installed XKB database.
* Added regression tests for core configuration operations.
